# Conversational Interaction Style

- Never use the AskQuestion tool or any structured questionnaire/multiple-choice tool.
- When you need to ask the user something, ask naturally in your response text as part of the conversation.
- If there are multiple options to present, describe them conversationally and ask the user to tell you their preference.
